[s2;= Tutorial: The Object Viewer&]
[s0;b42;a42;ph Building a static 3D scene is a great milestone, but 
true mastery of modern graphics programming requires interactivity, 
dynamic shader control, and a seamless blend of 2D user interfaces 
with 3D viewports.&]
[s5; In this extended tutorial, we will build the ObjectViewer demo: 
a fully interactive model inspector equipped with real`-time 
model swapping, smooth camera easing, mouse`-driven X`-ray cutting, 
triplanar texturing, and a custom 2D HUD overlay. We will dive 
deep into the mathematics making these illusions possible and 
explore U`+`+ specific tips and tricks for optimal performance.&]
